---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing | Panhandle Headlight Restoration"
  description="Three coating tiers: Clear Coat ($60, 6-mo), Clear Coat Pro ($80, 18-mo), Clear Coat UV ($100, 36-mo). Prices per pair for one vehicle. Add-on for heavy oxidation, larger headlights, or damage starts at $20. Military and first-responder discounts. Free within 30 mi of Marianna."
>
  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Simple pricing</span>
      <h2>Pick your protection level.</h2>
      <p>Prices below cover both headlights on one vehicle. A single add-on charge may apply for heavy oxidation, larger headlights (truck / van / SUV), or extensive damage &mdash; starting at $20, quoted on-site before we start.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tiers">
      <div class="tier">
        <h3>Clear Coat</h3>
        <div class="price">$60<small> / pair &middot; one vehicle</small></div>
        <ul>
          <li>Wet sand &amp; polish</li>
          <li>3M professional clear coat</li>
          <li>Best for light to medium haze</li>
          <li>6-month guarantee</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="tel:+18505836322">Book Clear Coat</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tier feature">
        <span class="flag">Most popular</span>
        <h3>Clear Coat Pro</h3>
        <div class="price">$80<small> / pair &middot; one vehicle</small></div>
        <ul>
          <li>Wet sand &amp; polish</li>
          <li>Delta Kits Infinity liquid coat</li>
          <li>Thicker film, UV stabilizers</li>
          <li>18-month guarantee &mdash; 3&times; the Clear Coat warranty for just $20 more</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+18505836322">Book Clear Coat Pro</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tier">
        <h3>Clear Coat UV</h3>
        <div class="price">$100<small> / pair &middot; one vehicle</small></div>
        <ul>
          <li>Wet sand &amp; polish</li>
          <li>GlasWeld COAT UV-cured hard coat</li>
          <li>UV-lamp cured&mdash;bonds to the lens</li>
          <li>36-month guarantee &mdash; factory-tier durability</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="tel:+18505836322">Book Clear Coat UV</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="discount-banner">Military, Veterans, Law Enforcement, First Responders, and School Employees: <strong>10% off</strong> any tier. Just show valid ID at your appointment.</p>
    <p class="fineprint">Free mobile service within about 30 miles of Marianna. 30 to 50 miles: a $25 trip fee. Beyond 50 miles (wider Panhandle, South Alabama, Southwest Georgia): a travel surcharge applies, and multi-vehicle or dealer batches are preferred. Fleet pricing (per vehicle): Clear Coat $50; Clear Coat Pro $65; Clear Coat UV $80. Add-on charge for retail jobs (does not apply to fleet): starting at $20, quoted on-site, applies to heavy oxidation OR larger headlights (truck / van / SUV / large housings) OR extensive damage repair. Only one add-on charge applies per vehicle regardless of the number of applicable factors. One discount per job; discounts apply to retail work and do not stack. Prices subject to applicable Florida sales tax.</p>

    <div class="sec-head" style="margin-top:4rem;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Compare</span>
      <h2>Why $60 pro beats a $20 kit.</h2>
      <p>Retail kits look cheap on the shelf. Here is what they actually cost you in Florida sun.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-wrap">
      <table class="compare-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Factor</th>
            <th>$20 kit from the parts store</th>
            <th>Panhandle Headlights</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Wet sanding grits</td>
            <td>3 to 4 pads at best</td>
            <td>Progressive grits 400 through 3000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>UV-rated sealant included</td>
            <td>Rarely, and even then not rated for FL UV</td>
            <td>Yes, professional coating, all three tiers</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Guarantee</td>
            <td>None</td>
            <td>6, 18, or 36 months in writing</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Time investment</td>
            <td>2 to 3 hours of your Saturday</td>
            <td>We come to your driveway</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Result in Florida sun</td>
            <td>Hazy again in 3 to 6 months</td>
            <td>Stays clear for the full warranty term</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Total cost</td>
            <td>$20 kit + 3 hours + no warranty</td>
            <td>$60 to $100 flat, warranty in writing</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="sms:+18505836322?&body=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20headlight%20quote.">Text for a free quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn-dark" href="tel:+18505836322" style="margin-left:.5rem;">Call (850) 583-6322</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .compare-wrap {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--paper-2);
  }
  .compare-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: var(--paper-2);
  }
  .compare-table th,
  .compare-table td {
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    vertical-align: top;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .compare-table thead th {
    background: var(--paper);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: .88rem;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
  }
  .compare-table thead th:last-child {
    color: var(--trust);
    background: rgba(47, 125, 225, 0.08);
  }
  .compare-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--paper); }
  .compare-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td:last-child { background: rgba(47, 125, 225, 0.05); }
  .compare-table tbody td:first-child {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    width: 26%;
  }
  .compare-table tbody td:nth-child(2) { color: var(--muted); }
  .compare-table tbody td:last-child {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: rgba(47, 125, 225, 0.03);
  }
  .compare-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .compare-table th, .compare-table td { padding: .75rem .85rem; font-size: .92rem; }
  }
</style>
